==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gd|en}} {{term|tàrmachan|lang=gd}}. The ''pt-'' comes from a mistaken Greek construction.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|RP}} {{IPA|/ˈtɑːmɪɡən/}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|ptarmigan|s}}

# Any of three [[species]] of small [[grouse]] in the [[genus]] ''[[Lagopus]]'' found in [[subarctic]] [[tundra]] areas of [[North America]] and [[Eurasia]].

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|species of small grouse}} {{l|en|lagopus}} {{qualifier|obsolete}}

====Derived terms====
* [[rock ptarmigan]], ''[[Lagopus muta]]''
* [[white-tailed ptarmigan]], ''[[Lagopus leucura]]''
* [[willow ptarmigan]], ''[[Lagopus lagopus]]''

